  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the lines&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>(</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">R</mi></math>,&nbsp;intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>. If a plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;passes through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> and is parallel to the lines <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to ______.</p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math>&nbsp;passes through&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Both the lines intersect at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Normal to the plane will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Since plane is parallel to both the given lines, the&nbsp;equation of the plane will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On comparing we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
  }
}